WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.760
SCP-682 Vs a Fighter Jet: Who would win?

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:06.480
Well, that depends on your definition of “win.”&nbsp;

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:10.800
In terms of short-term immobilization&nbsp;
required for getting 682 recontained,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:16.000
a fighter jet would likely be an asset to&nbsp;
any MTF hoping to get 682 back under control,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.560
given its high speed and weapons capable of&nbsp;
at least effectively stalling the monster.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.800
However, if we’re talking “to the death”&nbsp;
then we’ll have to consider that missiles&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:28.880
and conventional arms fire have&nbsp;
no lasting effect against 682.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:34.160
Given enough time, it would adapt to either fly or&nbsp;
fling projectiles capable of taking the jet down&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:40.720
or BOTH?! Imagine a flying, missile-launching&nbsp;
682? WOW that’s absolutely terrifying.

